# Makefile is the public interface

Follow the project skill [makefile-operations](../skills/makefile-operations/SKILL.md).

Never run `uv add`, `uv remove`, `uv lock`, or `uv sync` on the host. Use:

```bash
make uv-add PKG="package>=1.0"
make uv-remove PKG=package
make uv-lock
make uv-lock-regenerate
make uv-update
make uv-update PKG=foo
make tests
make lint
make format
```

Do not hand-edit `pyproject.toml` / `uv.lock` to add or drop dependencies.
